        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "In Spring, an Advisor is an aspect that contains only a single advice object associated with a pointcut expression."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Apart from the special case of introductions, any advisor can be used with any advice. "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "org.springframework.aop.support.DefaultPointcutAdvisor"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " is the most commonly used advisor class. It can be used with a "
          },
          {
